# Agents & Repository Documentation
#
# CLAUDE.md is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the accumulated record of what has
# already gone wrong in this repository -- the Gradle daemon traps, the ViewTree owners
# on the decor view, the DEX scan that proves nothing, the two adb commands that unbind
# the IME -- and every one of those entries cost a session to learn. Untracked, that
# knowledge lived on one machine and a fresh clone rediscovered it.
#
# Note it imports AGENTS.md and .agent/rules/, which are still ignored below, so those
# imports do not resolve in a fresh clone. Tracking them too is the obvious follow-up
# and is deliberately left as a decision rather than taken here.
.agent/
.agents/
.agents/skills/
AGENTS.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
AUTHORS.md

